WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.930
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, since we’ve
gotten past the doctor who christmas special

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:16.270
and series 8 is getting ready to film next
week I wanted to do a predictions video that

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:22.380
included some of the things that we actually
know already.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.009
My plan for the next couple of months is to
do at least one doctor who video a week.

00:00:26.009 --> 00:00:29.290
So sometimes when we learn new things about
series 8 it the videos will be about that

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.250
and other times they’ll be fun bonus videos
or q&amp;A videos if you guys have a lot of questions

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.250
you want me to answer.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.230
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.940
So what I’ll do in this video is start with
everything we do know, then do my top 5 predictions.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:40.940
So things we know.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:41.940
1 - Filming starts this monday.

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:42.940
january 6th.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.200
They only have half the episodes planned out,
which is 6.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.840
so they’ll finish the scripts for the second
half of the season while they’re making

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.350
this first batch.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:55.250
2 - All the episodes will air week to week
without a giant break like series 7.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:58.430
Raise your hand if you hated that break.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:03.300
3 - there will be 13 episodes and possibly
an easter special.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.720
No christmas special has been confirmed.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:12.000
4 - Returning characters include the patternoster
gang, vastra, jenny and strax, of course clara

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.360
is returning for the full series but Alex
Kingston said she might be coming back too

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.270
with her classic spoilers line.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.880
Remember her character’s relationship with
the doctor spanned multiple versions.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.350
Not just matt smith’s doctor.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.420
So it would totally be in keeping with canon
for her to interact with peter capaldi.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:32.030
5 - The first episode will feature vastra,
jenny and strax.

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:37.280
6 - There is currently a blue peter competition
to design a few sonic screwdrivers for each

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.240
of them to use in that episode.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:41.940
Can you imagine strax with a sonic screwdriver?

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:46.869
7 - Even though there are a few characters
returning steven moffat said in his own words

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:48.619
that he’s cleaning house.

00:01:48.619 --> 00:01:52.470
Meaning a lot of the anacronisms of matt smith’s
era won’t be there.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:56.960
I’ll talk more about that during predictions.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:03.119
8 - The directors have been announced for
several episodes and include, Ben Wheatley,

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:05.620
Paul Murphy, and Douglas Mackinnon.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:09.229
Each is doing two episodes, thus the 6 they’ll
start this monday.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:13.780
9 - Currently the writers that have been hired
back are mostly familiar faces including,

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.310
Mark Gatiss, Neil Cross, and Gareth Roberts
not including steven moffat.

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:18.250
Who’s writing that first episode.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:26.980
Writers currently still in talks are Chris
Chinball, Tom MacRae, Jack Lothien and possibly

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.180
Neil Gaiman.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.680
Although he said doctor who doesn’t pay
very well.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:30.680
So he’s a long shot.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:35.260
And his last episode nightmare in sliver was
supposed to be a two-parter, got smashed into

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.249
one and everyone was disappointed.

00:02:38.249 --> 00:02:40.639
So don’t expect him back.

00:02:40.639 --> 00:02:43.069
10 - The premiere will be after August.

00:02:43.069 --> 00:02:48.470
No official date yet but we could see episodes
by the end of august or september at the latest.

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:49.470
Time for predictions

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.219
First - the timelords.

00:02:51.219 --> 00:02:55.190
They tried to contact the doctor via the cracks,
successfully.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.930
That idea of them trying to bring gallifrey
back will be part of the larger narrative.

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:02.459
They’ll still be stuck in the pocket universe,
but because the daleks know what’s going

00:03:02.459 --> 00:03:05.450
on now there’s the constant threat of resuming
the time war.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:09.310
So series 8 will probably end with them still
stuck outside the universe.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:12.989
But they’ll still be able to telephone the
doctor via cracks.

00:03:12.989 --> 00:03:16.340
Second - Something else is going to try and
break into the universe.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.969
If the time lords can do it, then so can something
really awful.

00:03:19.969 --> 00:03:23.720
But because steven moffat is changing a lot
of aspects of the show, don’t expect it

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:27.590
to be a classic villain like the master or
another one of the time locked races that

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:31.489
david tennant mentions during the end of time.

00:03:31.489 --> 00:03:39.430
3 - The doctor will leave clara by the end
of the series.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:42.659
Meaning I expect to see a new companion during
series 9.

00:03:42.659 --> 00:03:46.809
Right now both capaldi and jenna louise coleman
are only signed on for series 8.

00:03:46.809 --> 00:03:49.730
I expect capaldi to stay for multiple series
although I’ve heard rumors his run will

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:50.730
be shorter than matt smith’s.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.439
4 - There will be a new original villain.

00:03:52.439 --> 00:03:55.489
Steven moffat created the silence during series
6 to be the main villains.

00:03:55.489 --> 00:03:58.839
He’ll do the same type of thing again in
series 8.

00:03:58.839 --> 00:04:01.249
Typically new baddies get introduced in the
first episode.

00:04:01.249 --> 00:04:06.329
But since it will be a brand new doctor it
could be another cracks in the universe type

00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:10.409
situation where the role typically given to
the antagonist is instead a new mystery.

00:04:10.409 --> 00:04:13.250
and number 5 - The cracks will still be there.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:17.370
Matt Smith’s doctor said that when he fixed
the universe it left a fundamental weakness

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.220
which is where the cracks come from.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:21.889
He never fixed that weakness before regenerating.

00:04:21.889 --> 00:04:23.990
So that will still be an issue.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:28.290
It will allow both good things like the time
lords to be part of the story but also the

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:34.639
new main villain.

00:04:34.639 --> 00:04:39.220
I know I talked about river song before I
did predictions, but since she’s already

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:46.240
gone ahead and teased it I think we can bump
her from maybe to probably to “spoilers”.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:55.000
Let me know what you think about the idea
of them using a new original villain instead

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.620
of a classic villain in series 8.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:59.910
Remember because of the cracks there’s still
the possibility that all those awful time

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.300
locked things could come back.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:08.700
Like I said, I’ll still be doing weekly
doctor who videos going forward, if you have

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:13.100
specific things you’d like to see me make
videos for just let me know in the comments.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:18.580
Right now click here for my christmas special
easter eggs and click here for my review of

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.040
sherlock series 3 episode 1.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.660
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.259
High Fives!

